## Final check

The textured focus render shows no black specks on the cap edge in the front, side, and back
views. The stem tip shows no black mark. One thin dashed seam mark of about 4 mm remains on the
cap edge in the three-quarter view. Green reports it and did not test a coarser detail, because
the step budget ended.

